750c3c","maturity":"draft","page_type":"entity","path":"pages/entities/dongdongunique-llm-rag-d13ae9750c3c.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":[],"title":"dongdongunique/llm_rag","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:48:04Z","updated_by_operation":"op_3b4dc8546dc94aa78ba65aef25289034"}
{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_2183d4c2850c0ec30741954eceac85a0b47109efaf5d70975b20cafd8314d36a"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The design is modular: new vector stores, LLMs, or document loaders are added via base classes (BaseVectorStore, BaseLLM, BaseDocumentLoader) and config settings like VECTOR_STORE_TYPE and LLM_TYPE."},{"claim_ids":["clm_2a1d985e72247a2b28c1f9612fd2e6c4018aa6c42f860aede7e43b8b5fa36c68"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The system can run in two modes: an interactive CLI started with 'python main.py' and a Gradio web UI started with 'python app.py'."},{"claim_ids":["clm_34bb24a9f5a65d9b68600ac71c6c3ac0436160665effa0ee0de707797fb9aee4"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"FAISS index files are stored in a vector_store_index directory, and events such as errors and indexing operations are logged to app.log for debugging or monitoring."},{"claim_ids":["clm_35394f2c49a48aa10085ef072f4c917580425943e750341f12f328bf28cdb7b1"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Setup involves creating a .env file containing OPENAI_API_KEY and installing packages with 'pip install -U -r requirements.txt'."},{"claim_ids":["clm_55869063d7741ee286441033c1311b8dfe1bda90ec26e0c72b88da48a8efab75"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Distributed vector stores, query expansion, custom embeddings, authentication, visualization, and batch processing appear to be unimplemented, since the README lists them as future improvements."},{"claim_ids":["clm_67e2a49da7662668ae8e2ccf4369ba5eac886a22054438ffefd57434714c0803"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Repository development practice: contributions are made by forking the repository, creating a new branch for a feature or bug fix, and submitting a pull request with detailed explanations."},{"claim_ids":["clm_68b24770725d9387916e13e4958da7d8cd24f6557df3e594bf4a0f0a38924181"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"requirements.txt lists langchain, openai, faiss-cpu, python-dotenv, pandas, langchain-community, tiktoken, and gradio; the README states Python 3.8+ and an OpenAI API key as requirements."},{"claim_ids":["clm_6f0cffc3367e656f264097f752e0db0d32ff2ca3faff17d8af808782d7bcbe65"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The Gradio UI reportedly supports CSV upload with automatic chunking, natural-language search with GPT-generated responses, and add/delete/update of document chunks."},{"claim_ids":["clm_84732f3136873dc6960e4dee79db126d2678424f3ee5ce17db035e4b554012ba"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Documented features include document loading/preprocessing, embedding generation, FAISS similarity search, GPT answer generation, and real-time CRUD operations on document chunks."},{"claim_ids":["clm_d87e381422d80853cfb57092e0c718350aff6aa19c190931cb11a61747170c20"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The documented layout includes a rag_system/ package (config, core, loaders, llms, utils, vector_stores), app.py, main.py, an example amazon_products.csv, and a vector_store_index directory for FAISS files."},{"claim_ids":["clm_e2bd32b2f5340cd221626d7398c06a61af1d928a829571c4062860b8ac41dd09"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The project implements a Retrieval-Augmented Generation system that indexes documents with FAISS and uses GPT to answer queries using retrieved document context."}],"claim_ids":["clm_2183d4c2850c0ec30741954eceac85a0b47109efaf5d70975b20cafd8314d36a","clm_2a1d985e72247a2b28c1f9612fd2e6c4018aa6c42f860aede7e43b8b5fa36c68","clm_34bb24a9f5a65d9b68600ac71c6c3ac0436160665effa0ee0de707797fb9aee4","clm_35394f2c49a48aa10085ef072f4c917580425943e750341f12f328bf28cdb7b1","clm_55869063d7741ee286441033c1311b8dfe1bda90ec26e0c72b88da48a8efab75","clm_67e2a49da7662668ae8e2ccf4369ba5eac886a22054438ffefd57434714c0803","clm_68b24770725d9387916e13e4958da7d8cd24f6557df3e594bf4a0f0a38924181","clm_6f0cffc3367e656f264097f752e0db0d32ff2ca3faff17d8af808782d7bcbe65","clm_84732f3136873dc6960e4dee79db126d2678424f3ee5ce17db035e4b554012ba","clm_d87e381422d80853cfb57092e0c718350aff6aa19c190931cb11a61747170c20